### POST to create a game
POST https://ddc-java.services/codebreaker-solitaire/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
"pool" : "ABCDE",
"length" : 2
}
###

### POST a guess
POST https://ddc-java.services/codebreaker-solitaire/games/l0fyaqfDQ8GpKVg6pPANCw/guesses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text" : "EC"
}
### GET the game status
GET http://ddc-java.services/codebreaker-solitaire/games/l0fyaqfDQ8GpKVg6pPANCw

